   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENM402 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Business English - Level 2 — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 12226 · Decision 1286/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/11/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ENM402 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Business English - Level 2 — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 12226 · QĐ 1286/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/11/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">ENM402</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Tiếng Anh Thương mại - Cấp 2_Business English – Level 2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Hours Per Course: 20 sessions<br><br>1 session = 135 minutes</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">Passed ENM302</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Lecture,Social Constructivism,Presentation,discussion,groupwork</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">12226</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">1286/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 11/22/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">11/22/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">ENM402</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Tiếng Anh Thương mại - Cấp 2_Business English – Level 2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Hours Per Course: 20 sessions<br><br>1 session = 135 minutes</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">Passed ENM302</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Lecture,Social Constructivism,Presentation,discussion,groupwork</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">12226</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">1286/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 11/22/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">11/22/2024</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>This course is designed to help students further improve their ability to communicate in English in a wide range of business and business-related situations at upper intermediate level of English. It also helps students develop necessary knowledge and skills to succeed in business. In addition to the business-focused contents, the course is enhanced with supplementary activities corresponding to B2+ level of the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages. In particular the course will help students:<br><br>* Communicate effectively in discussions, meetings, negotiations, socialization events<br><br>* acquire and effectively use professional skills including telephoning, presentations, correspondence exchange, decision making, and problem solving.<br><br>* enrich knowledge of business trends in the fast-changing world<br><br>* enhance students' employabilty</p>\n<h3>Note from the university</h3>\n<p>1) On-going assessment<br><br>- Progress test: 02*15%: 30%<br><br>- Assignment: 02*10%: 20%<br><br>2) Final Examination (FE) 50%<br><br>3) Final Result 100%<br><br>4) Completion Criteria:<br><br>a) On-going assessment &gt;0, Final Exam Score &gt;=4/10 &amp; Final Result &gt;=5/10<br><br>b) Each part of final exam must be &gt;0.<br><br>- If FE &lt; 4/10, student must take resit exam (all parts);<br><br>- If have a) but not b), student must take resit exam for the failed parts only</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>This course is designed to help students further improve their ability to communicate in English in a wide range of business and business-related situations at upper intermediate level of English. It also helps students develop necessary knowledge and skills to succeed in business. In addition to the business-focused contents, the course is enhanced with supplementary activities corresponding to B2+ level of the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages. In particular the course will help students:<br><br>* Communicate effectively in discussions, meetings, negotiations, socialization events<br><br>* acquire and effectively use professional skills including telephoning, presentations, correspondence exchange, decision making, and problem solving.<br><br>* enrich knowledge of business trends in the fast-changing world<br><br>* enhance students' employabilty</p>\n<h3>Ghi chú của trường</h3>\n<p>1) On-going assessment<br><br>- Progress test: 02*15%: 30%<br><br>- Assignment: 02*10%: 20%<br><br>2) Final Examination (FE) 50%<br><br>3) Final Result 100%<br><br>4) Completion Criteria:<br><br>a) On-going assessment &gt;0, Final Exam Score &gt;=4/10 &amp; Final Result &gt;=5/10<br><br>b) Each part of final exam must be &gt;0.<br><br>- If FE &lt; 4/10, student must take resit exam (all parts);<br><br>- If have a) but not b), student must take resit exam for the failed parts only</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12226\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12226</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12226\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=12226</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
